{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZoONEjiocO1794956697.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>迪士尼截至10月3日的第四季度純利，按年增長近一倍。盈利26.1億美元，經調整每股攤薄盈利1.51美元。</p><p></p><p>期內收入則上升一成半，至259.5億美元，高過預期的252億美元，其中娛樂部收入按年增長一成。集團正計劃進行重組，預期人事精簡計劃於2029財年前，為集團節省約30億美元成本。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:02:45.853622+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T22:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T19:57:35.545611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T23:56:01.322525+00:00","content_hash":"85529b2677de29e51df1a3c8ab17370e3fa82ecbe80f53b27b167f37e2aae327","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:02:45.853622+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}